 "why_questionable": "It averages in the 2023 positive FCF and understates the current run-rate by an order of magnitude. H1 2026 FCF was about -$25B and the 2026 run-rate is about -$50B or worse. Using a stale average makes the burn look smaller than it is. The MARKET DATA history may also not be recast for the xAI/X common-control merger, so the 2023-25 series may not be comparable with 2026."
 },
 {
